  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jer-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_jer-integration_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Downloads\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jer-integration/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/jer-integration.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"Versions\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Janoeo/JER-Integration?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"license\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/KkzqnzA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/630863620842061877?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p><h2>关于 JER 整合</h2><p><em><strong>JER 整合</strong></em> 是一个为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER)</a> 添加更多兼容性的模组。</p><p>为了实现这一点，JER 整合实现了以下兼容性补丁：</p><ul>\n<li>生物掉落（添加生物掉落的物品）</li>\n<li>地牢战利品（添加缺失的战利品表）</li>\n<li>矿石生成（添加缺失的矿石）</li>\n<li>植物掉落（添加植物掉落）</li>\n</ul><p>当前的兼容性列表可以在“依赖关系”部分找到。</p><h3>依赖关系</h3><p><strong>必需</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER)</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>可选 / 兼容</strong></p><ul>\n<li>兼容模组可能会经常变化，你可以在文件依赖列表中找到当前兼容的模组</li>\n<li>或者查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.alasdiablo.fr%252fjer-integration%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">JER 整合</a> 在线文档</li>\n</ul><h2>贡献</h2><p>如果你想贡献，可以通过以下方式：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">错误报告</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">功能请求</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">错误修复</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">任何有用的代码更改</a></li>\n<li>如果你想捐赠，目前我们没有 Patreon（或其他类似平台），所以你只需要在 CurseForge 上下载模组即可！</li>\n</ul><h2>许可证</h2><ul>\n<li>源代码基于 <a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a></li>\n</ul><h2>联系</h2><ul>\n<li>通过 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KkzqnzA\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 联系我们</li>\n</ul><h2>致谢</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AlasDiablo\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlasDiablo</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/liotamiu\" rel=\"nofollow\">lIotaMiu</a> - 原作者，主要贡献者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dadadodu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dadadodu</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/Safyrus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safyrus</a> - 测试，建议</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Janoeo/JER-Integration/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">所有贡献者</a> - 错误报告，错误修复</li>\n<li>以及所有下载我的模组的人！</li>\n</ul>",
